# omp.exe is never committed and never fetched or copied into the tree: it is linked into the VSIX from an external location
# (-p:PompOmpExe=<absolute path>, build\build.ps1 -OmpExe). This only guards against a copy dropped into a Vsix project folder.
src/Pomp.Vsix.*/omp/

